        "breadcrumb_label": "Our story",
        "hero_kicker": "Est. 1994 \u00b7 Yorba Linda, California",
        "hero_heading": "Built for People Who Connect Everything",
        "hero_body": "Since 1994, EZQuest has made it simpler to connect the devices that matter most \u2014 with products built to last and a team that stands behind every one.",
